Plasm
=====

Plasm's behavioral compatibility tests (tests/Plasm.Tests/EctoCompat.fs) adapt
test cases from Ecto:

  Ecto — https://github.com/elixir-ecto/ecto
  Copyright (c) 2013 Plataformatec
  Copyright (c) 2020 Dashbit
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

No Ecto source code is copied. The adapted tests re-express the observable
behavior of the following Ecto test files in F# against Plasm's API:

  - integration_test/cases/preload.exs
  - integration_test/cases/repo.exs
  - test/ecto/changeset_test.exs
  - test/ecto/multi_test.exs

The documentation of preload queries in lib/ecto/query.ex was consulted to
identify the global-limit semantics that Plasm deliberately rejects.

Each adapted test cites its source file and original test name.
